#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:394 FractionRingWidget.cpp:426
msgid ""
"Now the parts of the inside ring and outside ring have the same size, and we "
"can add the fractions!\n"
"\n"
"This is called finding the main denominator. The main denominator divides "
"the rings into equal parts."
msgstr ""
"Agora as partes dos aneis interior e exterior teñen o mesmo tamaño, e "
"podemos engadir as fraccións!\n"
"\n"
"Isto é o que se chama achar o denominador común. O denominador común divide "
"os aneis en partes iguais."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:401 FractionRingWidget.cpp:433
msgid "There is a smaller main denominator. Can you find it?"
msgstr "Hai un denominador común máis cativo, pode achalo?"

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:408
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You have just multiplied the first fraction by %1. Our main goal is to make "
"all parts be the same size. Try multiplying the first fraction by %2 and the "
"second fraction by %3."
msgstr ""
"Ven de multiplicar a primeira fracción por %1. O propósito é facer que todas "
"as partes teñan o mesmo tamaño. Probe a multiplicar a primeira fracción por %"
"2 e a segunda por %3."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:440
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You have just multiplied the second fraction by %1. Our main goal is to make "
"all parts be the same size. Try multiplying the first fraction by %2 and the "
"second fraction by %3."
msgstr ""
"Ven de multiplicar a segunda fracción por %1. O propósito é facer que todas "
"as partes teñan o mesmo tamaño. Probe a multiplicar a primeira fracción por %"
"2 e a segunda por %3."

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:479
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Inserted as %1 in the message below."
msgid "%2 of %1 painted parts."
msgstr ""

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:481
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Inserted as %2 in the message below."
msgid "%2 of %1 painted parts."
msgstr ""

#: FractionRingWidget.cpp:483
#, kde-format
msgctxt "%1 and %2 are the two messages translated above."
msgid ""
"The outside ring represents the left fraction. %1\n"
"\n"
"The inside ring represents the right fraction. %2\n"
"\n"
"The 'Multiply' button multiplies each fraction. Try one of them!"
msgstr ""
"O anel exterior representa a fracción esquerda. %1\n"
"\n"
"O anel interno representa a fracción dereita. %2\n"
"\n"
"O botón \"Multiplicar\" multiplica cada fracción. Probe un deles!"

#: exercisecompare.cpp:102
